/**
 * @file
 * @brief Doxygen group definitions for all subsystems.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup InterstellarCore Interstellar Core
 * @brief Core engine utilities such as logging, diagnostics, and system initialization.
 *
 * This includes foundational systems like logging (`Logger`), core enums (`LogLevel`),
 * and lifecycle hooks shared across all modules (data, config, input, rendering, etc.).
 */

/**
 * @defgroup LogLevelUtils Log Level Utilities
 * @ingroup InterstellarCore
 * @brief Provides string parsing and formatting utilities for log levels.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup LoggingSystem Logging System
 * @ingroup InterstellarCore
 * @brief Engine-wide logging interfaces and adaptive flushing mechanisms.
 *
 * Defines the `Logger` class, log categories, and adaptive flush strategies based on severity.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup Initialization Initialization Utilities
 * @ingroup InterstellarCore
 * @brief Engine startup procedures and low-level bootstrap interfaces.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup InputSystem Input System
 * @brief Core module for handling user input (mouse, keyboard, etc.).
 *
 * The Input module abstracts platform-specific input handling and exposes
 * interfaces for querying device states. This includes real-time polling and
 * frame-based state transitions.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup KeyCodes KeyCode Definitions
 * @ingroup InputSystem
 * @brief Enumerates platform-agnostic key identifiers.
 *
 * `KeyCode` allows consistent keyboard input across platforms.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup GameInterfaces Game Interfaces
 * @ingroup InputSystem
 * @brief Public input interfaces exposed to game logic.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup EngineInterfaces Engine Interfaces
 * @ingroup InputSystem
 * @brief Internal abstract extensions of the public interfaces.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup PlatformImplementations Platform Implementations
 * @ingroup InputSystem
 * @brief Concrete input backends for specific platforms (GLFW, SDL, etc.).
 */

/**
 * @defgroup InterstellarData Interstellar Data
 * @brief Shared scientific, physical, and domain-specific game data.
 *
 * Includes definitions such as chemical elements, planetary constants,
 * material properties, and any scientific reference information used in
 * simulation or rendering.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup InterstellarConfig Interstellar Config
 * @brief Configuration framework for serializing/deserializing game data.
 *
 * This includes JSON-driven configuration management, file IO abstraction,
 * editor serialization, and persistent modifiable settings (e.g., ElementConfig).
 */

/**
 * @defgroup ConfigStorage Config Storage
 * @ingroup InterstellarConfig
 * @brief Abstract file system interfaces for reading and writing configs.
 *
 * Includes `IConfigStorage`, `FileSystem`, and related components.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup JsonConfig Json Configuration
 * @ingroup InterstellarConfig
 * @brief Interfaces and utilities for JSON-based configuration objects.
 *
 * Includes `IJsonConfig`, `JsonConfigBase`, and helpers like `JsonManager` and `AppConfig`.
 */
